@host = http://127.0.0.1:8003
@token =54781676a8978eba608709426cc32a95daf32b2a4ceab86f671d916c54f4c5a1

### Consultar todos los clientes
GET {{host}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar un cliente por id
GET {{host}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear cliente
POST {{host}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "María Pérez",
    "telefono": "3001234567",
    "correo": "maria@gmail.com",
    "numero_licencia": "12345"
}

### Modificar cliente
PUT {{host}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "María Pérez Gómez",
    "telefono": "3007654321",
    "correo": "mariaPerez@hotmail.com",
    "numero_licencia": "12312345"
}

### Eliminar cliente
DELETE {{host}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial de alquileres de un cliente
GET {{host}}/clientes/1/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Varios clientes por ids
GET {{host}}/clientes?ids=1,2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
